OL,3,AHundreds of GP practices lose online
OL,4,Aservices after collapse of tech firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients in many parts of the country
OL,7,Fhave been left unable to access their
OL,8,FGP surgery online after a tech firm
OL,9,Fwent into administration.
OL,11,FSilicon Practice ran digital services,
OL,12,Fincluding websites, online booking and
OL,13,Fconsultations, for around 500 practices
OL,14,Fin England ` just under 10% of the
OL,15,Ftotal.
OL,17,FPractices across the country, including
OL,18,Fin London, Gloucestershire and Norfolk,
OL,19,Fhave reported problems. Services in
OL,20,FWales are also affected.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
