OL,3,AHundreds of GP practices lose online
OL,4,Aservices after collapse of tech firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FGP leaders said the problem would cause
OL,7,Fhuge disruption, given the scale of
OL,8,Fonline booking that now takes places.
